# License — data/meshes/

This directory contains two triangle-mesh datasets redistributed for the
RenderEngine sample/test corpus. Both are in the public domain per their
original sources. They are mirrored from the `alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models`
repository, which hosts each model in original format with its original source;
that repository carries no license of its own, so the individual source
licenses below apply (both public domain).

| File | Dataset | Original source | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| `bunny.obj` | Stanford bunny | Stanford 3D Scanning Repository (http://graphics.stanford.edu/data/3Dscanrep/), via `alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models` | Public domain (Stanford Computer Graphics Laboratory scan data) |
| `teapot.obj` | Utah teapot | Martin Newell (1975), via `alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models` | Public domain |

Pinned source URLs (SPEC section 7):

- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models/master/data/stanford-bunny.obj
- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alecjacobson/common-3d-test-models/master/data/teapot.obj

SHA256 checksums of the committed files are recorded in `data/README.md` and
SPEC section 7.
